19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bryan Jordan","x":"We're on track to achieve our cost savings and increase revenue opportunities with the merger.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/01/22/first-horizon-national-fhn-q4-2017-earnings-confer.aspx"},{"c":"FHN 2017 Q4","e":"fhn","d":"2018-01-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"BJ Losch","x":"On the balance sheet restructuring, I'm not sure that we have anything that's specifically planned.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/01/22/first-horizon-national-fhn-q4-2017-earnings-confer.aspx"},{"c":"FHN 2018 Q2","e":"fhn","d":"2018-07-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William C. Losch III","x":"We will deliver on our higher earnings accretion from Capital Bank via the cost savings and revenue synergies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/17/first-horizon-national-fhn-q2-2018-earnings-confer.aspx"},{"c":"FHN 2018 Q2","e":"fhn","d":"2018-07-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bryan Jordan","x":"As you suggest, I think BJ has got a slide in the deck that shows cost savings to-date.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/17/first-horizon-national-fhn-q2-2018-earnings-confer.aspx"},{"c":"FHN 2018 Q3","e":"fhn","d":"2018-10-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William C. Losch","x":"Our cost savings remain on track with 16 million of cost saves achieved as expected in the third quarter and that means about 75% of the costs are now in the run rate and should be substantially in the run rate fully by the end of this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/16/first-horizon-national-corp-fhn-q3-2018-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"FHN 2018 Q3","e":"fhn","d":"2018-10-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William C. Losch","x":"We're continuing to take cost out of the organization from the merger saves, and we'll be very disciplined as we have been about what we spend money on going into 2019 such that we're continuing to improve that efficiency ratio.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/16/first-horizon-national-corp-fhn-q3-2018-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"FHN 2019 Q1","e":"fhn","d":"2019-04-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William C. Losch III","x":"Restructuring charges, deferred compensation expenses, and variable comp from higher revenues and fixed income were the drivers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/16/first-horizon-national-corp-fhn-q1-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"FHN 2019 Q1","e":"fhn","d":"2019-04-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William C. Losch III","x":"In addition, you will see on the bottom right of slide six that we had about 12 million of restructuring charges related to some actions we took in the first quarter to improve our go-forward expense run rate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/16/first-horizon-national-corp-fhn-q1-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"FHN 2019 Q2","e":"fhn","d":"2019-07-16","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"D. Bryan Jordan","x":"There's a little bit of focus more prevalent today on tariffs and the impact of tariffs and what that may mean in decision making cycles, but overall, borrowers are constructive and still optimistic.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/16/first-horizon-national-corp-fhn-q2-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"FHN 2019 Q2","e":"fhn","d":"2019-07-16","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"William C. Losch III","x":"And so you know, I think, we've seen a lot of customers trying to get ahead of price increases as yields in the two to five year range in particular have been coming down.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/16/first-horizon-national-corp-fhn-q2-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"FHN 2019 Q2","e":"fhn","d":"2019-07-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William C. Losch III","x":"…was needed in the last several quarters, the management team at FTN did an excellent job of streamlining the business to be more profitable at moderated levels of volume while maintaining the power to capture profitable revenue and volume when the market opportunity presented itself and we…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/16/first-horizon-national-corp-fhn-q2-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"FHN 2019 Q2","e":"fhn","d":"2019-07-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William C. Losch III","x":"As I talked about before, our total reported expenses were up 1% linked-quarter, which included an incremental $10 million of notable items in the quarter including some remaining acquisition-related expenses in our previously disclosed restructuring and branding expenses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/16/first-horizon-national-corp-fhn-q2-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"FHN 2019 Q3","e":"fhn","d":"2019-10-16","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"D. Bryan Jordan","x":"And I think some of the impact is driven by tariffs or the expectation of tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/16/first-horizon-national-corp-fhn-q3-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"FHN 2019 Q3","e":"fhn","d":"2019-10-16","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Susan L. Springfield","x":"We really -- we does had a couple of customers that were impacted by tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/16/first-horizon-national-corp-fhn-q3-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"FHN 2019 Q3","e":"fhn","d":"2019-10-16","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"William C. Losch","x":"What I would tell you as it's very interesting is, as we've got more volume this quarter we've actually gained a bit more pricing power as well particularly toward the end of the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/16/first-horizon-national-corp-fhn-q3-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"FHN 2019 Q3","e":"fhn","d":"2019-10-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William C. Losch","x":"The primary drivers were restructuring expenses related to our efficiency actions, resolutions of legal matters and some acquisition-related charges primarily related to legacy, legal and employment agreement matters along with fixed asset impairments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/16/first-horizon-national-corp-fhn-q3-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"FHN 2019 Q3","e":"fhn","d":"2019-10-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William C. Losch","x":"We've reduced structural cost meaningfully by rightsizing our spend across all areas of our business rethinking how we deliver services to our customers based on what they want and improving processes to take out unnecessary cost.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/16/first-horizon-national-corp-fhn-q3-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"FHN 2019 Q4","e":"fhn","d":"2020-01-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William C. Losch III","x":"And number two, leverage the full year impact of merger cost savings and continue expense efficiency efforts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/17/first-horizon-national-corp-fhn-q4-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"FHN 2019 Q4","e":"fhn","d":"2020-01-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William C. Losch III","x":"Then if you look at how we're performing today, how we are taking cost out of our own organization, how we've done it in the Capital Bank deal, how much expertise Iberia has, integrating and doing the same types of things.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/17/first-horizon-national-corp-fhn-q4-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"FHN 2020 Q1","e":"fhn","d":"2020-04-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"D. Bryan Jordan","x":"The other thing that I pointed out when I commented about IBERIA Bank, when we do that merger of equals, we still feel very strongly that we can get at least $170 millionn of cost savings out of that combination.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/21/first-horizon-national-corp-fhn-q1-2020-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"FHN 2020 Q1","e":"fhn","d":"2020-04-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"D. Bryan Jordan","x":"But we think, by the time we get to the end of the year, even then, we will be at our 25% cost reduction level in 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/21/first-horizon-national-corp-fhn-q1-2020-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"FHN 2020 Q2","e":"fhn","d":"2020-07-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William C. Losch","x":"We continue to be very confident in our ability to generate the merger cost savings of $170 million over the next 18 months.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/17/first-horizon-national-corp-fhn-q2-2020-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"FHN 2020 Q2","e":"fhn","d":"2020-07-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William C. Losch","x":"And what we can control is, particularly in this environment, our support of our countercyclical businesses, our deposit pricing discipline and a huge lever, of course, for us is taking cost out of our combined organization in a very material way over the next several quarters.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/17/first-horizon-national-corp-fhn-q2-2020-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"FHN 2020 Q3","e":"fhn","d":"2020-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bryan Jordan","x":"…terms of a strong balance sheet, strong while taking capacity, strong capital and also positioned with a tailwind in the sense that we have our non -- our counter-cyclical businesses and we also have the ability to realize a significant amount of cost savings over the next 18 months to 24 months.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/23/first-horizon-national-corp-fhn-q3-2020-earnings-c/"},{"c":"FHN 2020 Q3","e":"fhn","d":"2020-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William Losch","x":"Again as Bryan said, in the third quarter, we delivered $8 million of cost savings, bringing the year-to-date total to $18 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/23/first-horizon-national-corp-fhn-q3-2020-earnings-c/"},{"c":"FHN 2020 Q4","e":"fhn","d":"2021-01-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William Losch","x":"We also combined procurement and expense systems, continued to streamline corporate real estate with much more to come.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/22/first-horizon-national-corp-fhn-q4-2020-earnings-c/"},{"c":"FHN 2020 Q4","e":"fhn","d":"2021-01-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William Losch","x":"In the fourth quarter, we delivered $14 million of cost savings, providing that annualized benefit of $56 million as we entered 2021.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/22/first-horizon-national-corp-fhn-q4-2020-earnings-c/"},{"c":"FHN 2021 Q1","e":"fhn","d":"2021-04-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bryan Jordan","x":"We achieved annualized merger related cost savings of $76 million in the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/21/first-horizon-national-corp-fhn-q1-2021-earnings-c/"},{"c":"FHN 2021 Q1","e":"fhn","d":"2021-04-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William Losch","x":"In our ongoing efforts to control what we can control, we are intensely focused on not only capturing merger efficiencies but continuing to streamline processes across the platform to position us well to continue to drive investments in the future.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/21/first-horizon-national-corp-fhn-q1-2021-earnings-c/"},{"c":"FHN 2021 Q2","e":"fhn","d":"2021-07-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bryan Jordan","x":"Excuse me -- at the same time, we are committed to continuing to drive enhanced efficiency by delivering $200 million in cost savings and controlling costs while still making prudent investments in technology and products to drive future revenue growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/19/first-horizon-corporation-fhn-q2-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"FHN 2021 Q3","e":"fhn","d":"2021-10-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Anthony Restel","x":"With regard to service charges, we recently began aligning key features across the legacy institutions approach to service charges, with the goal of simplifying and streamlining the experience for our clients.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/20/first-horizon-corporation-fhn-q3-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"FHN 2021 Q3","e":"fhn","d":"2021-10-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bryan Jordan","x":"We've talked about the impact on one-times, we've talked about the impact on delay in cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/20/first-horizon-corporation-fhn-q3-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"FHN 2025 Q2","e":"fhn","d":"2025-07-16","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bryan Jordan","x":"We are seeing improving customer confidence, but uncertainty remains around tariffs, interest rates, and the economic outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/16/first-horizon-fhn-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FHN 2025 Q2","e":"fhn","d":"2025-07-16","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bryan Jordan","x":"They process through some of the early impacts of tariffs and how that's gonna affect business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/16/first-horizon-fhn-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FHN 2025 Q2","e":"fhn","d":"2025-07-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bryan Jordan","x":"We continue to make significant progress in enhancing our organization, streamlining our go-to-market strategies, deepening collaboration between teams, and ensuring we are best positioned to capitalize on our opportunities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/16/first-horizon-fhn-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FHN 2025 Q2","e":"fhn","d":"2025-07-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bryan Jordan","x":"But as I said, an answer to a previous question, just the opportunities we see to standardize, streamline that go-to-market strategy, how we deliver value for our customers, our clients.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/16/first-horizon-fhn-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FHN 2025 Q4","e":"fhn","d":"2026-01-15","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"D. Bryan Jordan","x":"If you were sitting here in 2025, everybody had concerns about how tariffs were going to impact in the short run.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/15/first-horizon-fhn-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FHN 2026 Q1","e":"fhn","d":"2026-04-15","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Hope Dmuchowski","x":"It is less about cost savings right now in our outlook and more about being able to scale, invest in new hires, and grow our market share without having to add all of that support infrastructure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/15/first-horizon-fhn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FHN 2026 Q1","e":"fhn","d":"2026-04-15","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Jared David Shaw","x":"On the $100 million of incremental PPNR, what are any of the assumptions behind that for cost savings and/or potentially slower hiring driven by AI implementation?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/15/first-horizon-fhn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FHN 2026 Q1","e":"fhn","d":"2026-04-15","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Hope Dmuchowski","x":"We continue to maintain our full-year outlook and updated our near-term CET1 target to 10.5% during the first quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/15/first-horizon-fhn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"FHN 2026 Q2","e":"fhn","d":"2026-07-15","l":"ai_spend","r":"management"